Improper Input Validation The application processes user input directly from HTTP requests without sufficient validation, which can lead to SQL injection or other injection attacks., Insufficient Authentication and Session Management The application uses JWT for authentication but may not implement secure token storage or expiration handling, leading to potential session hijacking.

